neoxify-patch header: ios-udp-flows

Bounds the UDP flows of the iOS engine's TUN inbound, and the time a refused one
is held. A 256-packet queue per flow (upstream 1024); a flow ended after
120 s with no packet either way once replied, 15 s while unreplied, 10 s for
one to port 53; at most 64 flows at once, and 512 lookups beside them.
Upstream keeps a flow until its outbound gives up on it (300 s idle), and the
blackhole held a refused UDP flow 30-90 s. Written against xray-core v26.6.27
(45cf2898ab12): proxy/tun/udp_fullcone.go, proxy/blackhole/blackhole.go. Applied by
apps/mobile/scripts/xray-core-patch.sh, for the iOS build only. Measured
with TestEngineAppOpenLoad and guarded by TestEngineMemoryBudget
(plugins/vpn/xray), 2026-11-17.

